OL,3,GNEWSANitazene warning after drugs
OL,4,Aseized on island
OL,5,
OL,6,FPublic health officials have issued a
OL,7,Fwarning after tests found a highly
OL,8,Fpotent synthetic opioid in drugs seized
OL,9,Fby authorities.
OL,11,FThe alert has been issued in the Isle
OL,12,Fof Man, where substances recently
OL,13,Fexamined were found to contain
OL,14,Fnitazenes.
OL,16,FOfficials said the drugs are much
OL,17,Fstronger than heroin and are more
OL,18,Flikely to lead to overdose,
OL,19,Fhospitalisation and death.
OL,23,APub: 12-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB IOM NewsC Reg TVF Clean Feed
